  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nI find https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#windowproxy and https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#defaultproperties so be somewhat underspecified in terms of how to actually plug them into javascript.  For example, how would such an \"exotic object that wraps a [Window](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#window) ordinary object\" be created in practice, in terms of js spec operations?\n\nFor comparison, I find https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#js-observable-arrays much better documented; perhaps html proxy objects could be redefined along the same lines? ",
